flowchart TD
    START([Start])
    TASK[Agent undertakes a decision task]
    POLICY[Obtains active task policy]
    DECIDE[Chooses an action]
    APPROVAL{Approval required?}
    REQUEST[Requests approval]
    APPROVED{Approved?}
    EXECUTE[Executes action]
    CAPTURE[Records outcome]
    STORE[Stores episode]
    END([End])

    START --> TASK --> POLICY --> DECIDE --> APPROVAL
    APPROVAL -->|No| EXECUTE
    APPROVAL -->|Yes| REQUEST --> APPROVED
    APPROVED -->|Yes| EXECUTE
    APPROVED -->|No| END
    EXECUTE --> CAPTURE --> STORE --> END